<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brierley pays A$2.82/shr for Fairfax.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brierley pays A$2.82/shr for Fairfax.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd said on Monday it would pay an average of A$2.82 per share for the 20 percent of the issued capital in leading newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd.</p>
</text>
